# 默认：git 自动识别文本文件，签出/提交时一律规范化为 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换（防止被破坏）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary

# Windows 批处理脚本必须保留 CRLF，否则无法运行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
